SUMMARY:The Dot Project: Jack Penny: An Appetite That Survives All Feasts
DESCRIPTION:New paintings by Jack Penny explore greed\, appetite and huma
 n contradiction. Chefs serve as a playful tool\, and the works invite vi
 ewers' own readings.\nhttps://www.galleriesnow.net/shows/the-dot-project
 -jack-penny-an-appetite-that-survives-all-feasts/
