SUMMARY:Darkest Victorian London
DESCRIPTION:Explore forgotten corners just over the river\, from a pauper
 s’ burying ground to Little Dorrit’s prison. Guides voice chimney sw
 eeps\, pickpockets and more.\nPrice: Adult: £20 · Students & Seniors: 
 £15 · Children: £5\nhttps://www.walks.com/our-walks/darkest-victorian
 -london-the-dark-side-of-the-moon
LOCATION:Monument Underground station\, London (Fish Street Hill exit)\, 
 London
URL:https://www.walks.com/our-walks/darkest-victorian-london-the-dark-sid
 e-of-the-moon
END:VEVENT
