DTSTART:20261102T104500Z
SUMMARY:Sense and Sensibility
DESCRIPTION:A charming\, witty new take on Jane Austen's Sense and Sensib
 ility\, starring Daisy Edgar-Jones and Esmé Creed-Miles. It is a story 
 of love and sisterhood from Focus Features and Working Title.\nhttps://w
 ww.everymancinema.com/venues-list/x0712-everyman-baker-street/
LOCATION:Luxury Cinema Baker Street\, London
URL:https://www.everymancinema.com/venues-list/x0712-everyman-baker-stree
 t/
END:VEVENT
