SUMMARY:Silk Road Festival
DESCRIPTION:A three-month inaugural festival celebrating the historic Sil
 k Road through music. Highlights include Sufi Qawwali\, Baroque opera wi
 th Persian poetry and a jazz-tabla collaboration.\nPrice: Prices vary\nh
 ttps://www.timeout.com/london/things-to-do/silk-road-festival
